<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Baffin Bay - (built 1977) 19,024 dwt sold to Malaysian buyers for $3.3 million.</p>
<p>Galizano - (built 1981) 6,300 dwt sold to Norwegian buyers for $4 million.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Gemini Gas - 2,559 dwt sold to Malaysian buyers for $4.5 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
<p>-London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8071</p>
